#: crates/tvc-app/ui/pages.slint:641
msgctxt "FinderPage"
msgid ""
"This only reads from the monitor; nothing is written here. It compares the "
"manufacturer's undocumented codes before and after you change one setting "
"with the monitor's own buttons, so you can name what each code controls. A "
"named code then appears in Monitor settings."
msgstr "此工具只读取显示器，不会写入任何内容。它会比较你用显示器自身按钮更改某项设置前后，制造商未公开的代码，以便你为每个代码控制的内容命名。命名后的代码会显示在“显示器”设置中。"

